_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"raw_message":"feat(tui): show version in status bar"},{"id":"224ea900675cc80e0d6ab9ab11aa3a955b902f7a","message":"extract shared operations and tui widgets modules","body":"Business logic living inside cli, tui and mcp was duplicated across the\nthree surfaces, making it hard to keep them consistent. Introduce\nsrc/operations as the single place for domain logic (boards, cards,\ncheckin, comments, daily_work, projects, reminders, session, users,\nworking); cli, tui and mcp now act as thin adapters that call into it\nand only decide how to present the result.\n\nAlso extract src/tui/widgets (popup, scroll, text_input) so popups\nshare the same scroll-state, text-input-state and centered-popup\nrendering boilerplate instead of reimplementing it individually.","footers":[],"group":"Refactoring","breaking_description":null,"breaking":false,"scope":"core","links":[],"author":{"name":"ditr4drian","email":"adrian.ortiz@ditra.mx","timestamp":1786764947},"committer":{"name":"ditr4drian","email":"adrian.ortiz@ditra.mx","timestamp":1786764947},"conventional":true,"merge_commit":false,"statistics":{"files_changed":26,"additions":686,"deletions":419},"extra":null,"github":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"gitlab":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"gitea":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"bitbucket":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"azure_devops":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"raw_message":"refactor(core): extract shared operations and tui widgets modules\n\nBusiness logic living inside cli, tui and mcp was duplicated across the\nthree surfaces, making it hard to keep them consistent. Introduce\nsrc/operations as the single place for domain logic (boards, cards,\ncheckin, comments, daily_work, projects, reminders, session, users,\nworking); cli, tui and mcp now act as thin adapters that call into it\nand only decide how to present the result.\n\nAlso extract src/tui/widgets (popup, scroll, text_input) so popups\nshare the same scroll-state, text-input-state and centered-popup\nrendering boilerplate instead of reimplementing it individually."}],"commit_id":"727badb55cd521ba0fc7a37bdf2f85ac947634ef","timestamp":null,"previous":{"version":"v0.4.0","message":"Release v0.4.0","commits":[{"id":"44c40218185f6c6ca7fc91efa2c5593f5b91639f","message":"chore(changelog): update CHANGELOG.md and docs/changelog.json [skip ci]","group":null,"scope":null,"links":[],"author":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","timestamp":1786558382},"committer":{"name":"github-actions[bot]","email":"github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","timestamp":1786558382},"conventional":false,"merge_commit":false,"statistics":{"files_changed":1,"additions":1,"deletions":1},"extra":null,"github":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"gitlab":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"gitea":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"bitbucket":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"azure_devops":{"username":null,"pr_title":null,"pr_number":null,"pr_labels":[],"is_first_time":false},"raw_message":"chore(changelog): update CHANGELOG.md and docs/changelog.json [skip ci]"},{"id":"d2a696f93e4eaa5f0bdda690834f5c036ce0c920","message":"feat: add inline description editing and automate releases\n\n- Replace the external $EDITOR flow with a multiline TUI\ndescription popup supporting Ctrl+S to save.\n- Remove the unused tempfile dependency and refresh the lockfile.\n- Automate versioning, changelog generation,\nt